# Rotate-the-phone prompt (#493, D140): the amber curved arrow (clockwise, over the upper right), code mirrors it for the way back, native 64x64. Drawn on a grid and exported by tools/touch_control_sprites.py.
size 64 64
color k 14122b
color W ffffff
color L fdf3d0
color l d2bf84
color a ffc83a
color A c98a10
color s 3f4670
color S 7480b8
frame rotate-arrow
